t 0+5\\cdot 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{7} \\\\ -2 \\\\ \\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105708 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393173 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105751 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392494 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105752 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392487 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105752 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393361 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105753 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392134 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105793 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392023 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105793 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393548 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105793 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393555 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105793 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393562 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105876 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392755 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105903 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392972 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105903 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393694 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105903 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393701 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186105903 1038 #edb/ref 17592186393708 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186110590 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392762 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186110591 1038 #edb/ref 17592186392560 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186111173 1068 #edb/ref 17592186108733 13194139533464 17592186045585 false] [17592186111173 1068 #edb/ref 17592186392481 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186111173 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186111173 1071 "What is the graph of $y = \\arcsin x$?" 13194139533464 17592186045585 false] [17592186111173 1071 "What is the graph of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡x?$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186111173 1074 "Let's recall some of the basic properties of $y=\\operatorname{arcsin}