d "619ed97d-e84b-53da-afc0-cbcda9b4c479" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391157 1074 "Writing our system in matrix form, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]x(t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$\n\nSince our system is decoupled, its eigenvectors are the following:\n\n- Eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{1}=-3$ with the corresponding eigenvector $[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- Eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{2}=-4$ with the corresponding eigenvector $[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\nThe general solution of the system is\n\n$$\nx(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{-3t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{c}_{2}{e}^{-4t}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, notice that:\n\n- The straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-3t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on the $x$-axis. Since ${e}^{-3t}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\n- The straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{-4t}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on the $y$-axis. Since ${e}^{-4t}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions also approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nAmong the given options, there are two phase portraits satisfying these conditions:\n\n![](images/3f/3fdbeba46a0f4640e909b0ba489c1aec1fa87a6aa7740f19d08f274b7351d11b.png)\n\nLet's consider the solutions $x(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{-3t}$ and $y(t)={c}_{2}{e}^{-4t}$ provided that ${c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\ne 0.$ Then,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{y}^{′}(t)}{{x}^{′}(t)}=\\frac{({c}_{2}{e}^{-4t})^{′}}{({c}_{1}{e}^{-3t})^{′}}=\\frac{-4{c}_{2}{e}^{-4t}}{-3{c}_{1}{e}^{-3t}}=\\frac{4{c}_{2}}{3{c}_{1}}{e}^{-t}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ meaning that the tangents to the solution become more and more horizontal as the trajectories approach the origin. This corresponds to the following phase portrait:\n\n![](images/41/4193300af5a8950ce70e2c469812424235665faac279dac0c89289a0307ab46a.png)" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391159 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391160 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391161 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391162 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391163 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1079 #edb/ref 17592186391159 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391158 1080 #uuid "69405513-1dbb-597a-8b25-1607c72536b6" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391159 1081 "images/e8/e8e9a97ed196b5677e3c2ea6be32f4a1ab04f7721b3d9c41e4db284d69e6805a.png" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391159 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391159 1084 #uuid "6009f5a2-68a9-5943-8731-39f000ed0199" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391160 1081 "images/85/85cb5c01c72b8b903cc0b5fc8c593c0b6e96550380e6bc7af55d5db5b5f40d4e.png" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391160 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391160 1084 #uuid "1b93024f-8207-52ad-845f-920de06ed5b7" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391161 1081 "images/b4/b414b76f1fe20b5238e75281e57bb851c8e67777e225d7610631dab1b4921b82.png" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391161 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391161 1084 #uuid "4a78d0da-5220-5127-8319-73b4acac217f" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391162 1081 "images/d1/d19a6d30c12f5d966578cd950db1f16a9bc309f3a24a8e2480e52edca1281f75.png" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391162 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391162 1084 #uuid "c5cd3807-c498-5cde-99b9-07cd5a9bfab8" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391163 1081 "images/0c/0c70e2c185d054b8cc62411736ecec2e60a716d265819a82a171076d999ef4e6.png" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391163 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391163 1084 #uuid "cfaa09e6-0c8b-54b3-b59e-baf355087c3e" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1068 #edb/ref 17592186391165 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1068 #edb/ref 17592186391169 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1068 #edb/ref 17592186391172 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1069 "q-333224" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1071 "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=-2x(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=-4y(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options below regarding the given decoupled system of linear differential equations.$\\,$\nThe $x$-axis is a {{field-1}} line.\n\n$\\,$\nThe $y$-axis is a {{field-2}} line.\n\n$\\,$\nThe equilibrium point (origin) is {{field-3}}." 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1072 #uuid "d1c82443-160c-5ecb-b7e3-f0a7c6455443" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391164 1074 "Writing our system in matrix form, we have\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]x(t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}].$\n\nRecall that a homogeneous system of linear differential equations has a single equilibrium (fixed point) at the origin.\n\nSince our system is decoupled, its eigenvectors are the following:\n\n- Eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{1}=-2$ with the eigenvector $[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$ The corresponding straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-2t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on the $x$-axis and approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, the $x$-axis is the $\\text{stable}$ line.\n\n- Eigenvalue ${\\lambda }_{2}=-4$ with the eigenvector $[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ The corresponding straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{-4t}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on the $y$-axis and also approach the origin as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, the $y$-axis is the $\\text{stable}$ line.\n\nTherefore, the equilibrium point (origin) is $\\text{a stable node (sink)}.$ \n\n**Note:** The phase portrait of the system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/06/062b58a307f6d40c7be59d527cc01d7d301bd3f0115a0074ba0f3dca54412425.png)" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391166 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391167 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391168 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1077 "field-3" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1079 #edb/ref 17592186391166 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391165 1080 #uuid "ec537181-46cd-5656-9b07-265e8db0cda5" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391166 1081 "a stable node (sink)" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391166 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391166 1084 #uuid "b653a6f8-189a-5b30-8676-00bdf69976b1" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391167 1081 "a saddle point" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391167 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391167 1084 #uuid "76824f50-2011-5389-8865-1c3c99710ea9" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391168 1081 "an unstable node (source)" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391168 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391168 1084 #uuid "42384210-dd8