\text{new}} & =y+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\sqrt{y}+\\frac{1}{2}({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand moving all terms to the left-hand side gives the equation\n\n$$\n{y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{1}{2}({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-y-\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\sqrt{y}=0.\n$$\n\nSo, the general form of the function $g$ for step size $Δx=1$ is\n\n$$\ng({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{1}{2}({x}_{\\text{new}})^{2}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-y-\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}\\sqrt{y}.\n$$\n\nNow, in the first step, the new $x$ value is\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{new}}=x+Δx=1+1=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the function used in the first step is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g({y}_{\\text{new}}) & ={y}_{\\text{new}}-\\frac{1}{2}(2)^{2}\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-1-\\frac{1}{2}(1)^{2}\\sqrt{1} \\\\  & ={y}_{\\text{new}}-2\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391395 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391396 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391397 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391398 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391399 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1079 #edb/ref 17592186391398 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391394 1080 #uuid "df1f67de-316f-5c29-b742-1caa63eae0d6" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391395 1081 "g({y}_{\\text{new}})={y}_{\\text{new}}-\\sqrt{{y}_{\\text{new}}}-\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391395 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391395 1084 #uuid "a65f23d9-ece1-5d94-9f1b-4fa3ff21de35" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [175921863