}_{1},{y}_{2}) & =|\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3}-2x & 10x-5{x}^{3} \\\\ ({x}^{3}-2x)^{′} & (10x-5{x}^{3})^{′}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}{x}^{3}-2x & 10x-5{x}^{3} \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-2 & 10-15{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =({x}^{3}-2x)(10-15{x}^{2})-(10x-5{x}^{3})(3{x}^{2}-2) \\\\  & =x({x}^{2}-2)\\cdot 5(2-3{x}^{2})-5x(2-{x}^{2})(3{x}^{2}-2) \\\\  & =5x({x}^{2}-2)(2-3{x}^{2})-5x({x}^{2}-2)(2-3{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-15{x}^{5}+40{x}^{3}-20x-(-15{x}^{5}+40{x}^{3}-20x) \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich is $\\text{zero for all }x\\in R.$\n\nTherefore, the set ${{y}_{1}(x),{y}_{2}(x)}$ is linearly $\\text{dependent}$ on $R.$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391415 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391416 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391415 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391417 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391415 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391415 1077 "field-2" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391415 1079 #edb/ref 17592186391416 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391415 1080 #uuid "3d21f3c6-f7fb-5b6c-8dd7-e35248a7f05f" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391416 1081 "zero for all $x\\in R$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391416 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391416 1084 #uuid "ec6a8eb8-c109-597e-96bb-9b561c34d9d3" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391417 1081 "nonzero for at least one $x\\in R$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391417 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391417 1084 #uuid "f80fe0e9-1b8c-541a-b5cc-2a5606205e85" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391419 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391420 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391421 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391418 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391422 131941395