{z}^{′}+3 & =2x(9{x}^{2}+6xz+{z}^{2})-12{x}^{2}z-36{x}^{3}+18{x}^{3}+3 \\\\ {z}^{′}+3 & =2x{z}^{2}+3 \\\\ {z}^{′} & =2x{z}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can solve the obtained equation using separation of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =2x{z}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{1}{{z}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x} & =2x \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{{z}^{2}}\\frac{\\text{d}z}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {z}^{-2}\\,\\text{d}z & =\\int 2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ -\\frac{1}{z} & ={x}^{2}+C \\\\ z & =-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\n\nFinally, let's substitute $z=y-3x$ to recover the initial variable $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C} \\\\ y-3x & =-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C} \\\\ y & =-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C}+3x \\\\  & =3x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391440 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391441 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391442 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391443 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391444 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1079 #edb/ref 17592186391441 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391439 1080 #uuid "511785b1-2779-58b5-8f9d-56d17a54890e" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391440 1081 "y=3x+\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}+C}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391440 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391440 1084 #uuid "124e7252-c219-570f-b100-c0298de29b8e" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391441 1081 "y=3x-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+C}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [1759218