C$ corresponding to the specific solution, we apply the initial condition $y(0)=-1$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(0) & =2+C{e}^{-4(0)} \\\\ -1 & =2+C(1) \\\\ C & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution to the initial value problem is\n\n$$\ny=2-3{e}^{-4x}.\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391613 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391614 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391615 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391616 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1075 #edb/ref 17592186391617 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1077 "field-2" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1079 #edb/ref 17592186391613 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391612 1080 #uuid "75c53fba-addc-5347-89bc-46926b4cec8a" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391613 1081 "2-3{e}^{-4x}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391613 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391613 1084 #uuid "13c71556-c8bb-509e-b7b6-813b830221cd" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391614 1081 "1-2{e}^{-4x}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391614 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391614 1084 #uuid "dfc0fd51-b3d5-5b60-822b-55ce1a39a048" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391615 1081 "4-5{e}^{4x}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391615 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391615 1084 #uuid "ff5f9c6d-a3bd-55c8-a595-021440af2d20" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391616 1081 "-{e}^{4x}" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186391616 1084 #uuid "2ff86545