v}_{3}$ must correspond to ${\\lambda }_{3}=6.$ \n\nTo compute the eigenvectors of a matrix, we need to find non-zero solutions of the matrix equation \n\n$$\n(A-\\lambda I)\\text{x}=0.\n$$\n\n \n\nIn our case, we have $\\lambda =6.$ So, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-\\lambda I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & -5 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 6\\end{aligned}]-6[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & -11 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the eigenvectors corresponding to this eigenvalue, we have to solve the corresponding homogeneous system of linear equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{1}=0 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}-11{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ {x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we row-reduce the augmented matrix $M$ to row echelon form using Gaussian elimination, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & -11 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] &  & {R}_{1}↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -3 & -11 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -5 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] &  & \\begin{aligned}{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\ {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+5{R}_{1}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 10 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] &  & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+2{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there are two pivot columns (the $1$st and the $2$nd). Thus, ${x}_{3}$ is a free variable. From the second equation, we obtain ${x}_{2}=0.$ From the first equation, we get ${x}_{1}=0.$ Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nSetting, for instance, ${x}_{3}=1,$ we get the following eigenvector:\n\n$$\nv=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ b \\\\ c\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nFinally, $\\frac{a}{c}=\\frac{0}{1}=0.$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392046 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392047 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392048 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392049 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392050 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1079 #edb/ref 17592186392048 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392045 1080 #uuid "60b86f5a-a5c7-5a8b-9d41-513f5f26be40" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392046 1081 "2" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392046 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392046 1084 #uuid "13304c66-59ed-5804-b519-223c3709ae32" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392047 1081 "1" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392047 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392047 1084 #uuid "317f7bc8-17c3-5b65-8500-5bfb85e37bde" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392048 1081 "0" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392048 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392048 1084 #uuid "808dfd35-c7cf-5560-bba9-dfef1206fd03" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392049 1081 "-1" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392049 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392049 1084 #uuid "94090702-def0-5eac-8760-9a3b321889de" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392050 1081 "-2" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392050 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392050 1084 #uuid "7cb0fced-9501-56c9-8088-68d6df8fb853" 13194139533464 17592186045585