\\begin{aligned}| & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} \\\\ | & |\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\,⇒\\,{A}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get the following projection:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}14 & 9 \\\\ 9 & 6\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}[\\begin{aligned}6 & -9 \\\\ -9 & 14\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392362 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392363 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392364 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392365 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392366 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1079 #edb/ref 17592186392366 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392361 1080 #uuid "3f5082e4-d9ee-539a-9cb4-b5f824bb8ce6" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392362 1081 "[\\beg