e] [17592186392367 1072 #uuid "52165617-f2b7-52fc-a5ce-09980394cfc1" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392367 1074 "First, we need to find the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nConsider the augmented matrix $M$ of the system, which we reduce to row echelon form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 8 & -6 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nIn the reduced matrix above, there is $1$ pivot column (the $1$st one). Thus, ${x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ are free variables. Now, from the first equation, we get ${x}_{1}=4{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}.$ Therefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{2},\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nConsequently, $B={[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}$ is the basis of the solution space of the system.\n\nNow, we find the orthogonal projection of $x$ onto the solution space of the system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{S}\\,x & =A({A}^{T}\\,A)^{-1}\\,{A}^{T}\\,x \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {([\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}])}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 13 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot {[\\begin{aligned}17 & -12 \\\\ -12 & 10\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot \\frac{1}{26}[\\begin{aligned}10 & 12 \\\\ 12 & 17\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}13 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392369 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392370 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392371 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392372 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392373 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1079 #edb/ref 17592186392371 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392368 1080 #uuid "7ca78264-e6c8-572f-88da-a3f19c5a8e15" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392369 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392369 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392369 1084 #uuid "c77eba07-dc07-589f-8884-be6f0d03ee21" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392370 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392370 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392370 1084 #uuid "fbcee9a5-69aa-5708-aafe-a127637a0cc5" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392371 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392371 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392371 1084 #uuid "893aaa25-971c-54ca-85d4-517d467f5514" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392372 1081 "[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392372 1083 #edb/ref 1759218604