 1074 "To find the second derivative of a vector-valued function, we find the second derivatives of the components.\n\n- For $x(t)=\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) & ={sec}^{2}⁡t \\\\ {x}^{″}(t) & =2{sec}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- For $y(t)=\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(t) & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t \\\\ {y}^{″}(t) & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡t{tan}^{2}⁡t+{sec}^{3}⁡t \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡t({tan}^{2}⁡t+{sec}^{2}⁡t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{″}(t) & =⟨{x}^{″}(t),\\,{y}^{″}(t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2{sec}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sec}⁡t({tan}^{2}⁡t+{sec}^{2}⁡t)⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392737 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392738 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392739 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392740 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392741 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1079 #edb/ref 17592186392739 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392736 1080 #uuid "30603a02-99ff-59c6-861c-ce870828f5cd" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392737 1081 "⟨2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sec}⁡t({tan}^{2}⁡t+{sec}^{2}⁡t)⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392737 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392737 1084 #uuid "fe19103f-5f99-576d-a025-053904208525" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392738 1081 "⟨2{sec}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,{sec}^{3}⁡t⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392738 1083 #edb