\\cdot 0\\cdot 1)-(2\\cdot 0) \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we  substitute  the obtained values in  the Taylor series:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(x) & =y(0)+x{y}^{′}(0)+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2!}{y}^{″}(0)+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3!}{y}^{(3)}(0)+⋯ \\\\  & =2+x\\cdot 0+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}\\cdot 2+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}\\cdot 2+⋯ \\\\  & =2+{x}^{2}+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+⋯\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392865 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392866 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392867 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392868 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186392869 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1079 #edb/ref 17592186392868 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392864 1080 #uuid "e5212084-eef7-5bc4-9ed0-b74d742ac65b" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392865 1081 "y(x)=2+2{x}^{2}+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{3}+⋯" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392865 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392865 1084 #uuid "5688b562-955c-52e2-a47e-7a591492aa39" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392866 1081 "y(x)=2+\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{2}+⋯" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392866 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392866 1084 #uuid "55719890-f9bc-5d07-a9a2-fd83cb617e16" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392867 1081 "y(x)=2+2{x}^{2}+\\frac{{x}^{3}}{6}+⋯" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392867 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186392867 1084 #uuid "40655268-e069-5aac-8c4d-445e5042e25a" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [