lar to the line that goes through the points \n$A(2,1,0)$ and $B(3,2,1).$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393042 1072 #uuid "be607052-6286-5c45-a7b0-2a7d8e65a24b" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393042 1074 "First, we note that the position vector of $Q$ is $q=⟨2,1,-1⟩.$\n\nSince the line  passes through the points $A(2,1,0)$ and $B(3,2,1)$ we can find a vector parallel to the line:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =⟨3,2,1⟩-⟨2,1,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,1,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨1,1,1⟩.$ \n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩ & =⟨2,1,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩ & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393044 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393045 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393046 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393047 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393048 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393044 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393043 1080 #uuid "eb32e226-7bfb-5486-b6de-65722871d5f4" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393044 1081 "r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩=2" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393044 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393044 1084 #uuid "1a5ad7cf-e4ff-58ff-83bd-f3f78d2bf29c" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393045 1081 "r\\cdot ⟨2,1,-1⟩=⟨1,1,1⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393045 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 1759218