 true] [17592186393111 1071 "Find ${(u(t)f(t))}^{′}$ where $f(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} \\\\ {e}^{4t} \\\\ {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]$ and $u(t)=t.$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393111 1072 #uuid "3a49de4c-5d1f-5ca3-aa1a-4ebaca430818" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393111 1074 "Using the scalar function multiple rule, we can write\n\n$$\n{(u(t)f(t))}^{′}={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${f}^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{3t}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{4t}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{5t})\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{3t} \\\\ 4{e}^{4t} \\\\ 5{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u(t)f(t))}^{′} & ={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =1\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} \\\\ {e}^{4t} \\\\ {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}3{e}^{3t} \\\\ 4{e}^{4t} \\\\ 5{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{3t} \\\\ {e}^{4t} \\\\ {e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}3t{e}^{3t} \\\\ 4t{e}^{4t} \\\\ 5t{e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(3t+1){e}^{3t} \\\\ (4t+1){e}^{4t} \\\\ (5t+1){e}^{5t}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393113 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393114 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393115 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393116 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393117 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393112 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393117 13194139533464 17592186045585