 1084 #uuid "6c9432b2-20cf-5e0d-b627-365bf8bb517b" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393156 1081 "a=⟨5,\\,2t⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393156 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393156 1084 #uuid "5aeefe63-a288-5b47-85c7-d2a2775613d9" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393157 1081 "a=⟨5,\\,4t⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393157 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393157 1084 #uuid "ee5fa715-a949-54b8-a77a-babd9c98996a" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393158 1081 "a=⟨5,\\,2⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393158 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393158 1084 #uuid "5f894125-91dc-5e2c-bd9f-0d467b5542d7" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393159 1068 #edb/ref 17592186393160 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393159 1069 "q-7161" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393159 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393159 1071 "The position vector $r$ of a particle $P$ (relative to a fixed origin $O$) at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nr=⟨9{t}^{2}-12t,4t+17⟩.\n$$\n\nCalculate the acceleration vector $a.$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393159 1072 #uuid "31054e53-d905-5451-9de9-677fd754227a" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393159 1074 "To compute the acceleration vector, we need to differentiate the velocity vector. So first, we need to compute the velocity vector, which we can do this by differentiating the position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(9{t}^{2}-12t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4t+17)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨18t-12,\\,4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(18t-12),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨18,\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393161 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393162 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393163 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393164 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393165 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393162 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393160 1080 #uuid "5e1a18c0-8ad6-5833-ac15-05410c96661f" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393161 1081 "a=⟨18t-12,\\,4⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393161 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393161 1084 #uuid "e308dc50-8d1a-5be8-8bbc-ac3c0f36ba24" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393162 1081 "a=⟨18,\\,0⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393162 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393162 1084 #uuid "09d66d5c-4d57-5f45-b863-d859d6731c3c" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393163 1081 "a=⟨9,\\,4⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393163 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393163 1084 #uuid "21f4858f-79e0-56bc-b9f1-8a92538ca3c5" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393164 1081 "a=⟨9,\\,0⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393164 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393164 1084 #uuid "6e19d831-00d7-51e2-a2c5-b5965a41872f" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393165 1081 "a=⟨9t,\\,4⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393165 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393165 1084 #uuid "de3d11e8-96e8-5e70-9677-d7323e70e0d9" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393166 1068 #edb/ref 17592186393167 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393166 1069 "q-7165" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393166 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393166 1071 "The position vector $r$ of a particle $P$ (relative to a fixed origin $O$) at time $t$ is given by\n\n$$\nr=⟨\\frac{{t}^{5}}{5},\\,3{t}^{2}-1⟩.\n$$\n\nCalculate the acceleration vector $a.$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393166 1072 #uuid "018374cc-40c9-5d0d-a1b9-641708c13290" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393166 1074 "To compute the acceleration vector, we need to differentiate the velocity vector. So first, we need to compute the velocity vector, which we can do this by differentiating the position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{{t}^{5}}{5}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{2}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4},\\,6t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the acceleration vector, we differentiate the velocity vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{4}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4{t}^{3},\\,6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393168 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393169 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393167 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393170 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [175921863