6045585 true] [17592186393173 1071 "Let $c=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $d=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].$ Find the vector projection of $c$ onto $d.$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393173 1072 #uuid "4a5f805d-9915-543e-b3c6-5d61cd49da57" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393173 1074 "Using the formula for the vector projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{d}\\,c & =\\frac{c\\cdot d}{d\\cdot d}d \\\\  & =\\frac{{c}_{x}{d}_{x}+{c}_{y}{d}_{y}+{c}_{z}{d}_{z}}{{d}_{x}^{2}+{d}_{y}^{2}+{d}_{z}^{2}}d \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 3+1\\cdot (-3)}{{1}^{2}+{3}^{2}+(-3)^{2}}d \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{19}⟨1,3,-3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{4}{19},\\frac{12}{19},-\\frac{12}{19}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393175 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393176 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393177 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393178 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393179 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393176 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393174 1080 #uuid "81ed75df-1ce1-5ebc-81a9-b722c6382e6e" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393175 1081 "⟨0,0,0⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393175 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393175 1084 #uuid "2b3a993e-29b5-59cb-99e5-ded901d8bd0a" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393176 1081 "⟨\\frac{4}{19},\\frac{12}{19},-\\frac{12}{19}⟩" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393176 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393176 