e reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x-y=4 \\\\ x+2y=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}].$ This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 1}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now find the solution to this system as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7}[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393223 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393224 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393225 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393226 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1075 #edb/ref 17592186393227 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1077 "selection" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1079 #edb/ref 17592186393225 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393222 1080 #uuid "b977679f-6256-57c2-8887-0c386f7a473b" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393223 1081 "x=-\\frac{1}{7}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]" 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393223 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533464 17592186045585 true] [17592186393223 1084 #uuid "40c24857-06a2-5e0b-85d2-5f